{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨晚（27日）播出的TVB節目《玩住學。學住玩》，陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne）帶同7歲囡囡Abi前往尼泊爾 …</p><p></p>\n<p>昨晚（27日）播出的TVB節目《玩住學。學住玩》，陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne）帶同7歲囡囡Abi前往尼泊爾，希望讓女兒感受當地濃厚的宗教氣息。Leanne精心安排參觀大佛塔及女神廟，但Abi似乎全程無心裝載，場面一度尷尬。沒想到旅程最後竟被一款地道甜品扭轉氣氛，究竟發生了什麼事？\n</p>\n<h2>Leanne帶女參觀大佛塔 望囡囡感受宗教文化</h2>\n<p>Leanne與囡囡Abi此行的目的地是尼泊爾首都加德滿都，她出發前表示希望女兒能接觸不同地方的文化，她說：「Abi成日問我有關神嘅嘢，去加德滿都因為啲人成日話（當地）神多過人。想畀佢感受世界有不同類型宗教。」母女首站便去到著名的大佛塔，Leanne解釋帶Abi到訪的原因：「帶 Abi 嚟係覺得呢度係好神聖嘅地方，嚟呢度畀佢感受下唔同地方文化。」在參觀期間，Leanne不停為Abi灌輸宗教知識，可惜囡囡似乎既聽不明白，亦無心裝載，表現得興趣缺缺。</p>\n<h2>直擊女神廟萬人空巷 2歲女神去年登基</h2>\n<p>接下來，Leanne母女轉到女神廟，靜待「活女神」出巡，現場情況萬人空巷，氣氛莊嚴。據悉，要成為當地的「活女神」需符合「三十二相」的嚴格標準，並要通過勇氣試煉，絕非易事。而現任的女神於去年9月才正式登基，當時年僅2歲8個月，非常年輕。Leanne希望透過親身經歷，讓Abi對世界的多樣性有更深刻的體會，即使女兒當下未必完全理解，也希望在她心中種下一顆種子。\n</p>\n<h2>囡囡Abi對宗教零興趣 反被地道甜品征服豎起姆指</h2>\n<p>雖然對宗教文化提不起勁，但Abi在飲食方面卻展現出驚人的適應力。晚上Leanne帶她出外覓食，先後品嚐了尼泊爾薄餅及多款特色街頭小食。最令人意想不到的是，當Abi嚐到當地的甜點「牛奶餅」時，竟然雙眼發光，更馬上向鏡頭豎起姆指大讚好吃，滿足的表情與之前參觀時的木訥形成強烈對比，看來美食才是收服小朋友的最佳武器。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚行程有意義 「呢啲先係真正嘅親子教育」</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，不少網民都認為Leanne安排的行程非常有心思，並對兩母女的互動表示讚賞。有網民留言指：「Leanne真係好有心，帶個女去呢啲地方唔係個個家長做到。」、「Abi個反應好真實，小朋友對食嘅興趣大過聽故仔好正常！」、「個活女神文化好特別，多謝個節目介紹。」、「睇到Abi食牛奶餅個樣好滿足，好可愛！」、「呢啲先係真正嘅親子教育，唔係淨係去主題樂園。」\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2_15898935916ae17cba676b5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2_15898935916ae17cba676b5.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3_18985024046ae17cc3a3ff2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3_18985024046ae17cc3a3ff2.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4_19794910226ae17cd1e1011.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4_19794910226ae17cd1e1011.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7_4909218236ae17ceeb7f1a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/7_4909218236ae17ceeb7f1a.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/8_16747723766ae17cf7217bd.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/8_16747723766ae17cf7217bd.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/9_9254504896ae17d012f069.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/9_9254504896ae17d012f069.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_8707845196ae17d0f6d196.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_8707845196ae17d0f6d196.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_6386093926ae17d3e5b2b6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_6386093926ae17d3e5b2b6.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_14120792866ae17d47054ae.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_14120792866ae17d47054ae.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_15903030886ae17d50bcade.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_15903030886ae17d50bcade.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_3125025256ae17d59b2b61.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_3125025256ae17d59b2b61.png\" width=\"807\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%a9%e4%bd%8f%e5%ad%b8%e5%ad%b8%e4%bd%8f%e7%8e%a9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玩住學學住玩</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%ac%a6%e6%9b%89%e8%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">符曉薇</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e6%9f%8f%e5%ae%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳柏宇</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531501\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:49.001209+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1472,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:30:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:46.085907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:41.312348+00:00","content_hash":"b993874480cc59d2b051c4d03663d47cebccc709bdbfd282f9c4aa52c56f6f39","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}